%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% requires: resident-outlines
% Scenario: Palatino text embeds Pagella. Palatino-Roman is resident
% with the TeX Gyre Pagella outlines, so the document holds one embedded
% Type 1 font named by the Pagella font name with a subset tag, subset
% to P, a, and .notdef, and the text operation references it.
% Expect: one page.
/Palatino-Roman findfont 12 scalefont setfont
100 700 moveto (Pa) show
showpage
